+		// holds the right hand's socket, which the gun hangs from, 26.8 cm along
+		// the hand and 7.5 cm to the thumb side, against the empty hand's 6.9 cm
+		// along (player_shotgun_aim_idle_rarm.fbx, idle_stand.fbx), which would
+		// draw hand and gun 20 cm behind the real hand; and its fire animation
